53
00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:52.680
All of that cultural memory,
pretty much that has become unmanageable.

54
00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:57.760
So how is it taking books,
articles, wiki pages

55
00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:01.560
and putting training that
so that it becomes

